digistain|PHYS||Moderate|GENERIC|Spectral imaging of biopsies scored by AI to predict cancer recurrence|medical imaging models on tissue scans -> P2|Spectral signatures from biopsies shift with slide preparation, so the model must hold up across labs.
ballerine|AGENT_EVAL|P4|Moderate|RAG|AI agents that underwrite and monitor merchant risk|risk agents producing explainable decisions need evaluation -> P3|Merchant risk agents need explainable decisions tested against past fraud cases before acquirers rely on them.
common-paper|LEGAL||Moderate|GENERIC|Standard commercial contracts with structured, machine-readable terms|contract platform for legal and sales teams -> P5|Structured contract data stays useful only while negotiated deviations from the standard terms are captured cleanly.
vantel|RAG||Moderate|AGENT_EVAL|AI platform for commercial insurance brokerages|brokerage work runs on policies and submissions = document extraction -> P4|Commercial policies bury endorsements and exclusions deep in long forms, so coverage comparison is an extraction problem.
besimple-ai|VOICE_EXCLUDED||None|PHYS_EVAL|Collecting and annotating conversational audio data for speech models|core product is speech data for voice models|Diarization labels on overlapping speech are where most conversational audio datasets lose quality.
codecrafters|GENERIC||None||Programming courses where engineers build real systems|education product, no matching technical proof point|Automated graders for build-your-own Redis must check protocol behavior across many languages.
coverage-cat|GENERIC||None|RAG|AI-native insurance broker that optimizes coverage and price|insurance brokerage, no proof point is the same problem|Recommending coverage limits starts with reading each customer's existing policy terms accurately.
netmaker|GENERIC||None||WireGuard virtual networks across clouds, edge and Kubernetes|networking infrastructure, no matching technical proof point|Mesh VPNs at scale depend on key distribution and NAT traversal across heterogeneous networks.
karbon-card|GENERIC||None||Corporate cards and payments for Indian businesses|fintech, no matching technical proof point|Startup-friendly underwriting depends on cash flow data rather than collateral.
cogram|RAG|P7|Moderate|DIAGRAM|AI tools for architecture and engineering firms over project documents|agents over project documents, RFIs and submittals = retrieval -> P4|Answering questions across specs, RFIs and submittals requires retrieval that tracks which revision is current.
human-dx|GENERIC||None|AGENT_EVAL|Open medical intelligence combining collective clinician input and ML|nonprofit diagnosis project, too general for a proof point|Aggregating many clinicians' differentials into one ranked answer needs careful weighting by case difficulty.
trela|GENERIC||None||Healthy grocery marketplace in Brazil|marketplace, no matching technical proof point|Grocery margins depend on demand forecasting per supplier to limit spoilage.
